# Go workspace: go.work IS committed (WS-011 / F039) — it is the multi-module
# matrix CI and every clone use to resolve cross-module refs to the working tree.
# go.work.sum is committed alongside it so the workspace's checksums are
# reproducible (the published module go.mod/go.sum carry the real requires).

